# Artifacts of the out-of-source configure that the runners here perform.
#
# 0.configure.default_make.sh and 5.configure.hdf5_make.sh run the top-level
# configure inside this directory, which drops a Makefile, setup/ and DATA/
# here. bin/, obj/ and lib/ are already covered by the top-level .gitignore.
Makefile
config.log
config.status
setup/
DATA/
OUTPUT_FILES/

# test output
#
# The runners remove their scratch logs on success, so these only appear
# when something failed -- which is exactly when they must not be committed.
results.log
error.log
info.log
anchors.log
loc.log

# module files from compiling gf_manufactured.f90 alongside a test
*.mod
